      "source_ids": [
        "S1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "function": "insight",
      "scene_type": "rv_readout",
      "spoken": "The engineering lecture does the sums: compression costs only about a sixth of what expansion gives back. That is why so much work is left over at the end. Compression is the investment, expansion is the return.",
